{"notice_id":24278041,"sections":[{"kind":"SettledContract","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"CON-0001","values":[{"field_id":"BT-150-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"1"},{"field_id":"BT-3202-Contract","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"TEN-0001"},{"field_id":"BT-721-Contract","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"BplusL Infra Log GmbH, 09212 Limbach-Oberfrohna"},{"field_id":"OPT-316-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"contract","type":"id","value":"CON-0001"}]},{"kind":"Lot","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"LOT-0001","values":[{"field_id":"BT-01(c)-Procedure","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"vob-a-eu"},{"field_id":"BT-115-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"BT-137-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"Lot","type":"id","value":"LOT-0001"},{"field_id":"BT-21-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Baustelleneinrichtung 1. - 6. BA, Neues Palais, Sanierung Dachgeschoss 2. BA"},{"field_id":"BT-22-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"internalID","type":"id","value":"2241169"},{"code":"works","field_id":"BT-23-Lot","list":"contract-nature","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-24-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Die Baustelleneinrichtung beinhaltet das Einrichten, Vorhalten und wieder Abbauen von Lagerflächen, Bau-, Umkleide-, Material- und Sanitärcontainern. Die Arbeiten erfolgen gemäß den vorliegenden Baustelleneinrichtungsplänen und unterschiedlichen Etappen.\n\n- Einrichten einer Skulpturenlagerfläche mit Pflasterprotokoll und Schutzlage (Asphalt) für das historische Mopkepflaster\n- Liefern, aufbauen, unterhalten, betreiben, umsetzen gem. Baufortschritt und abbauen von Bauzäunen und Bautoren\n- Liefern, aufbauen, unterhalten, betreiben, umsetzen gem. Baufortschritt und abbauen von Mobilen Baustellen-Toiletten, Sanitärcontainer (für Weißbereich), Sanitärcontainer (für Schwarz- / Weißbereich) und Stiefelwaschanlagen \n- Liefern, aufbauen, unterhalten, betreiben, umsetzen gem. Baufortschritt und abbauen von Pförtnercontainer, Aufenthaltscontainern, Besprechungscontainern und Materialcontainern"},{"field_id":"BT-536-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-10-30"},{"field_id":"BT-537-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2027-12-17"},{"field_id":"BT-58-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"BT-60-Lot","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-AddInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-Mediator","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0005"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0003"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0004"}]},{"kind":"ContractingParty","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ContractingParty#0","values":[{"code":"rcr","field_id":"BT-10-Procedure-Buyer","list":"authority-activity","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"body-pl-ra","field_id":"BT-11-Procedure-Buyer","list":"buyer-legal-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-300-Procedure-Buyer","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"}]},{"kind":"LocalLegalBasisWithID","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-LocalLegalBasisWithID#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-01(c)-Procedure","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"vob-a-eu"}]},{"kind":"LotAwa